==Battleground==
*1 [[Lord Enma]] spawns after 3.33 seconds<sup>100f</sup>.
*1 [[Heavenly Le'saint]] spawns after 76.67 seconds<sup>2,300f</sup>.
*3 [[Dashing Face]]s spawn after 16.67 seconds<sup>500f</sup>, delay 53.33 seconds<sup>1,600f</sup>.

==Strategy==
Lord Enma and Heavenly Le'saint are both strong midranged attackers. Luckily, they're both outranged by [[Crazed Lizard Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Dual]] [[Lizard Cat (Normal Cat)|Dragons]] and [[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|Crazed Bahamut Cat]]! Build up attackers on Dashing Face, then take down Lord Enma as quickly as possible with [[Fish Cat (Normal Cat)|Island Cat]] and/or [[Crazed Fish Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Crazed Whale Cat]]. He should hopefully die before Heavenly Le'saint spawns, which will make he cleanuo process a breeze with [[Rocker Cat (Rare Cat)|Ramen Cat]] and a few cheap meatshields.

